ity along when you stream.When the festival begins, jump in! If you enjoy the demo, please leave a Steam review to help other players discover the game as we get closer to release.Wishlist the game to stay in the loop, and stay tuned for more exciting news coming soon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:46:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2508440-1839676055898223","game_id":"steam-2508440","kind":"announcement","title":"Angel Guardian Brings Twitch-Integrated Gameplay to Steam Cyberpunk Fest","summary":"The wait is over! The free Angel Guardian demo is now available on Steam as part of Steam Cyberpunk Fest.Inspired by classic 90s anime, Angel Guardian is a fast-paced sci-fi action platformer where you fight through a collapsing space station to rescue the young prince Eiji.What makes it different?Play it as a traditional single-player action game or enable Twitch Mode directly from the main menu and let your viewers influence every run in real time.Your chat can:⚔️ Spawn enemies🔫 Send ammo✨ Act","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T19:02:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055898223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2508440-1838407329254460","game_id":"steam-2508440","kind":"announcement","title":"Angel Guardian Demo arrives August 3 during Steam Cyberpunk Fest","summary":"We're thrilled to announce that the Angel Guardian demo launches on August 3 as part of Steam Cyberpunk Fest!Whether you've been following development for years or just discovered the game, this is your first chance to jump into Alterra and experience what we've been building.🎮 What you'll playThe demo features the first three levels of Angel Guardian, where you'll:⚔️ Battle through fast-paced action combat🔫 Master a growing arsenal of powerful weapons🤖 Face challenging enemies and your first bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T15:01:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329254460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2508440-1828441623105547","game_id":"steam-2508440","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank YOU for an incredible playtest.","summary":"Our latest playtest for Angel Guardian has come to an end.Over the past weeks, players from all over the world jumped into Alterra, fought alongside Kita and Eiji, and experienced the game in their own way. Watching that unfold has been one of the most meaningful parts of development so far.We’re already using your feedback to improve combat feel, balance, and overall flow. Every run, every comment, and every stream is helping us shape the experience into something stronger.A special shoutout to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-27T20:02:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623105547","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2508440-1826362059921703","game_id":"steam-2508440","kind":"announcement","title":"Stream Angel Guardian on Twitch — Get your portrait in the game","summary":"What if streaming could place you inside the game itself?We’ve introduced a new community feature: streamers can now become part of the world as one of the rescued Guardians players encounter during their mission.If you stream on Twitch using Twitch Mode, you will receive a custom portrait in the game’s style, featured directly in the station as a rescued character.Yes — you can become part of Alterra’s lore.What is Twitch Mode?Twitch Mode connects your stream directly to the game and lets your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-05T16:09:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059921703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2508440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2508440":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2508440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z"},"4610200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2508440","app_id":2508440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"387268b6df6b3f469b177d87de72f13eef3ee0f03752ec51a4d1bc032d4ee75f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Angel Guardian is a sci-fi side-scrolling action shooter set in a space station under attack. Play as Kita, a warrior guardian on a mission to rescue the young prince while fighting hostile enemies. Use shooting, stealth and hacking to face powerful bosses and prove yourself as a true guardian.","publishers":[{"name":"Corgee inc"}],"developers":[{"name":"Corgee inc"}]},"release"